WEBVTT - Class 1 English Mridang Chapter 8: The Four Seasons

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:45.000
<v Teacher Tara>Summer is here! The golden sun shines high and bright. Sweet yellow mangoes hang from the branches, and cold lemonade tastes delicious!

00:00:45.000 --> 00:01:30.000
<v Teacher Tara>Look at those big dark clouds! Raindrops fall pitter-patter on our umbrella. Children float colourful paper boats across rainwater puddles!

00:01:30.000 --> 00:02:15.000
<v Teacher Tara>The rain stops, and cool breezes blow. Leaves turn golden yellow and dance gracefully down from the trees like golden butterflies!

00:02:15.000 --> 00:03:00.000
<v Teacher Tara>Brrr! Winter mornings are crisp and misty. We put on warm woollen sweaters, wrap cosy scarves, and enjoy warm milk before starting our day!

